 default-dbus-system-bus | dbus-system-bus,
Description: D-Bus service and tools for managing sched_ext schedulers
 scx_loader is a D-Bus service that starts, stops and switches sched_ext
 schedulers on request. It is started on demand by D-Bus.
 .
 This package contains:
  - scx_loader: the D-Bus service, with its systemd unit, D-Bus policy
    and polkit action
  - scxctl: a command-line client for scx_loader
  - scxtui: a terminal user interface for scx_loader
